{
  "embeddedAssets": {
    "assets": [
      {
        "dataBase64": "",
        "id": "sample.sprite-crt.locked_sprite_texture",
        "mime": "image/png",
        "name": "retro-scene.png"
      }
    ],
    "bindings": {
      "locked_sprite_texture": "sample.sprite-crt.locked_sprite_texture"
    }
  },
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_curve",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 3296
        },
        "text": "`c = uv − ½`, `uv' = ½ + c × (1 + curvature × |c|²)`: the screen edge samples further out than the centre. The same scaled vector gives the screen mask `1 − smoothstep(0.495, 0.5, max(|x|, |y|))`, so everything beyond the curved glass is transparent."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_tex",
        "position": {
          "x": 3522,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1154
        },
        "text": "The **Chromatic Aberration** node samples the sprite three times; red is pushed further from the centre than blue (radial mode), like a cheap lens."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_scan",
        "position": {
          "x": 4880,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "**CRT Scanlines** darken between lines (phase scrolls with time). The phosphor mask is three cosines `½ + ½cos(2π(x·density − k/3))` — one per channel, floor `1 − strength` — multiplied onto the colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_final",
        "position": {
          "x": 7462,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`vignette = 1 − v × smoothstep(0.2, 0.72, |c'|)`; flicker = `1 − amount × ½(1 + sin(97t))`; the result is multiplied by *Brightness*."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 9738,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Colour and the screen-shaped alpha."
      }
    ],
